--- text
Reset your [PRODUCT_NAME] password

Someone asked to reset the password for the [PRODUCT_NAME] account
registered to [EMAIL_ADDRESS]. The link below opens a page where
you can set a new password. We will never ask you to send us a
password, and this email does not contain your old password.

Choose a new password:

[CTA_URL]

This link expires at [EXPIRY_ABSOLUTE] - [EXPIRY_RELATIVE] after it
was sent.

Important: If you did not ask for this, someone may know your email
address. You can ignore this email. Your password will not change
until the link above is used, so there is nothing you need to do.

If you get these emails and you did not ask for them, write to
[SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
